## Capability Statement Requirements

Every auto-generated capability statement MUST include:

**Header:**
- DEE DAVIS INC company name
- Logo placeholder (dee_davis_inc_logo.png)
- CAGE Code: 8UMX3
- UEI: HJB4KNYJVGZ1
