## If Service Contract (Needs Subcontractor)

When the opportunity is a service contract (grounds maintenance, janitorial, courier, etc.):

**ALSO auto-generate:**
- Subcontractor outreach email (place in SEND_TO_SUBCONTRACTOR/)
- Follow the never-reveal-buyer rules for subcontractor communications
- Identify 3-5 potential local subcontractors
- Place subcontractor research in root folder (INTERNAL)

